"Your Sendy installation is unable to get your SES quota from Amazon because "
"your server clock is out of sync with NTP. To fix this, Amazon requires you "
"to <strong>sync your server clock with NTP</strong>. Request your host to "
"sync your server clock with NTP with the following command via SSH:"
